  "semanticReview": [
    "All three original/current complete modules, ToolGateway/ConsolePresenter/CLI error-code controls and actual CLI diagnostic display caller read. Error-code table is a stable data reference, not a direct diagnostic caller.",
    "ANSI explicit non-undefined argument returns immediately; otherwise NO_COLOR trimmed nonempty wins, accepted FORCE_COLOR values precede stdout.isTTY. No caching/environment writes. colorize retains original text when off and raw tone lookup/control wrapping when on.",
    "Foreign fields are own descriptor values without invoking their ordinary field accessors/toString/toJSON; Proxy descriptor traps may execute and are caught. Native DOMException name getter is captured at module initialization, brand errors fall back to own name data.",
    "Every current error layer reads original status/errno/native name/message first. Valid100–599 integer HTTP classification precedes file/network/abort/timeout/internal messages; any later valid HTTP replaces prior candidate, while other candidates replace only transport_error. This does not choose retries or gameplay fallback.",
    "lastError nullish-coalesces to cause. Non-nullish primitive lastError ends traversal rather than visiting cause; repeated object terminates, maximum8 layers. Retry-After is own lowercase header string with1–5 integer digits and optional1–3 decimal digits, finite integer milliseconds at most86400000; no date/whitespace/sign parsing.",
    "Output includes only code plus accepted diagnostic metadata and dictionary message; no original arbitrary error message or entire headers/body copied. JSON/localization failures remain the original call behavior.",
    "Speech regex anchors the beginning, allows repeated whitespace-surrounded reserved labels and case-insensitive English, preserving embedded same text. Original raw.replace(...).trim() calls and exceptions stay unchanged, without new String conversion or permission claims.",
    "Actual gateway cleans before validator call and preserves its shallow-copy/getter order. Console/CLI callers select locale, print or set exit state themselves; these utilities do not commit game actions or own transport close."
  ],
